Release
├── Features
│   ├── Tables
│   └── Diagrams with a long description
│       that wraps at narrow widths
└── Docs

┌─ plantuml - class - not supported ┐
│ @startuml                         │
│ class User {                      │
│   name : string                   │
│ }                                 │
│ @enduml                           │
└───────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ plantuml - sequence - unsupported line 3 ┐
│ @startuml                                 │
│ A -> B : call                             │
│ [-> A : incoming                          │
│ @enduml                                   │
└───────────────────────────────────────────┘

The paragraph after the diagrams is
rendered normally.
